This directory is filled by `npm run build` in web/ and embedded into the Go
binary via //go:embed. It is intentionally empty in version control -- the file
you are reading only exists so that the embed directive resolves on a fresh
clone, before the frontend has been built.

The SvelteKit static adapter wipes this directory on every build, so `make web`
and `build.ps1` recreate this file afterwards. If it goes missing, `go build`
still works locally but fails on a fresh clone.
